{{!
    @template mod_playerpuzzle/giveup_dialog

    The three ways out of a match, a native <dialog> opened from the stage's flag button: keep playing, leave
    and come back later, or give up. Each button is described by the line under it. The dialog is moved inside
    the game's container when the game boots, so it also shows in full screen.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - The dialog's title
    * cancellabel - The button that goes back to the match
    * canceltext - What going back does
    * exitlabel - The button that leaves the match to finish it later
    * exittext - What leaving does
    * confirmlabel - The button that gives up
    * text - What giving up costs

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Leave the match?",
        "cancellabel": "Keep playing",
        "canceltext": "Close this window and go back to the match.",
        "exitlabel": "Leave and continue later",
        "exittext": "The match is saved as it is: back in the Lobby, Play continues this phase.",
        "confirmlabel": "Give up",
        "text": "This counts as a defeat: one attempt is spent and the coins earned in this phase are lost."
    }
}}
<dialog id="playerpuzzle-giveup" class="pp-giveup pp-themed" aria-labelledby="pp-giveup-title">
    <h2 id="pp-giveup-title" class="pp-giveup-title">{{title}}</h2>
    <div class="pp-giveup-option">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="pp-giveup-cancel" aria-describedby="pp-giveup-cancel-text" autofocus>{{cancellabel}}</button>
        <p id="pp-giveup-cancel-text" class="pp-giveup-option-text">{{canceltext}}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-giveup-option">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="pp-giveup-exit" aria-describedby="pp-giveup-exit-text">{{exitlabel}}</button>
        <p id="pp-giveup-exit-text" class="pp-giveup-option-text">{{exittext}}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-giveup-option">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" id="pp-giveup-confirm" aria-describedby="pp-giveup-text">{{confirmlabel}}</button>
        <p id="pp-giveup-text" class="pp-giveup-option-text">{{text}}</p>
    </div>
</dialog>
